017300         DISPLAY 'CLRRS130 OPEN FAILED RPTOUT ' WS-RPTOUT-STATUS
017400         MOVE 16 TO RETURN-CODE
017500         GOBACK
017600     END-IF
017700     MOVE WS-RUN-DATE TO RH1-RUN-DATE
