025500     END-EVALUATE
025600     PERFORM 2100-FETCH-NEXT
025700     PERFORM UNTIL WS-END-OF-DATA
025800         PERFORM 2200-PROCESS-ROW
025900         PERFORM 2100-FETCH-NEXT
