027200          INTO :CLM-CLAIM-ID, :CLM-POLICY-NO, :CLM-PRODUCT-CD
027300               , :CLM-PERIL-CD, :CLM-LOSS-DT
027400               , :CLM-NOTIFIED-TS, :CLM-CHANNEL-CD
027500     END-EXEC
