027700         WHEN 0
027800             ADD 1 TO WS-CLAIM-READ
027900         WHEN +100
028000             SET WS-END-OF-DATA TO TRUE
028100         WHEN OTHER
028200             MOVE '2100-FETCH-NEXT' TO ERR-PARA
028300             PERFORM 8000-SQL-ERROR
028400     END-EVALUATE
028500     .
